{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "bookCode": "RV10",
  "bookSlug": "rig-veda-book-10",
  "n": 118,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "refId": "RV10-118:1",
      "text": "translated by"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "refId": "RV10-118:2",
      "text": "1. AGNI, refulgent among men thou slayest the devouring fiend,",
      "original": "अग्ने हंसि न्यत्रिणं दीद्यन्मर्त्येष्वा ।",
      "translit": "agne haṃsi nyatriṇaṃ dīdyanmartyeṣvā |"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "refId": "RV10-118:3",
      "text": "Bright Ruler in thine own abode.",
      "original": "स्वे क्षये शुचिव्रत",
      "translit": "sve kṣaye śucivrata"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "refId": "RV10-118:4",
      "text": "2. Thou springest up when worshipped well the drops of butter are thy joy",
      "original": "उत्तिष्ठसि स्वाहुतो घृतानि प्रति मोदसे ।",
      "translit": "uttiṣṭhasi svāhuto ghṛtāni prati modase |"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "refId": "RV10-118:5",
      "text": "When ladies are brought near to thee.",
      "original": "यत्त्वा स्रुचः समस्थिरन्",
      "translit": "yattvā srucaḥ samasthiran"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "refId": "RV10-118:6",
      "text": "3. Honoured with gifts he shines afar, Agni adorable with song:",
      "original": "स आहुतो वि रोचतेऽग्निरीळेन्यो गिरा ।",
      "translit": "sa āhuto vi rocate'gnirīḷenyo girā |"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "refId": "RV10-118:7",
      "text": "The dripping ladle balms his face.",
      "original": "स्रुचा प्रतीकमज्यते",
      "translit": "srucā pratīkamajyate"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "refId": "RV10-118:8",
      "text": "4. Agni with honey in his mouth, honoured with gifts, is balmed with oil,",
      "original": "घृतेनाग्निः समज्यते मधुप्रतीक आहुतः ।",
      "translit": "ghṛtenāgniḥ samajyate madhupratīka āhutaḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "refId": "RV10-118:9",
      "text": "Refulgent in his wealth of light.",
      "original": "रोचमानो विभावसुः",
      "translit": "rocamāno vibhāvasuḥ"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "refId": "RV10-118:10",
      "text": "5. Praised by our hymns thou kindlest thee, Oblation-bearer, for the Gods",
      "original": "जरमाणः समिध्यसे देवेभ्यो हव्यवाहन ।",
      "translit": "jaramāṇaḥ samidhyase devebhyo havyavāhana |"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "refId": "RV10-118:11",
      "text": "As such do mortals call on thee.",
      "original": "तं त्वा हवन्त मर्त्याः",
      "translit": "taṃ tvā havanta martyāḥ"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "refId": "RV10-118:12",
      "text": "6. To that Immortal Agni pay worship with oil, ye mortal men,-",
      "original": "तं मर्ता अमर्त्यं घृतेनाग्निं सपर्यत ।",
      "translit": "taṃ martā amartyaṃ ghṛtenāgniṃ saparyata |"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "refId": "RV10-118:13",
      "text": "Lord of the house, whom none deceives.",
      "original": "अदाभ्यं गृहपतिम्",
      "translit": "adābhyaṃ gṛhapatim"
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "refId": "RV10-118:14",
      "text": "7. O Agni, burn the Raksasas with thine unconquerable flame",
      "original": "अदाभ्येन शोचिषाग्ने रक्षस्त्वं दह ।",
      "translit": "adābhyena śociṣāgne rakṣastvaṃ daha |"
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "refId": "RV10-118:15",
      "text": "Shine guardian of Eternal Law.",
      "original": "गोपा ऋतस्य दीदिहि",
      "translit": "gopā ṛtasya dīdihi"
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "refId": "RV10-118:16",
      "text": "8. So, Agni, with thy glowing face burn fierce against the female fiends,",
      "original": "स त्वमग्ने प्रतीकेन प्रत्योष यातुधान्यः ।",
      "translit": "sa tvamagne pratīkena pratyoṣa yātudhānyaḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "refId": "RV10-118:17",
      "text": "Shining among Uruksayas.",
      "original": "उरुक्षयेषु दीद्यत्",
      "translit": "urukṣayeṣu dīdyat"
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "refId": "RV10-118:18",
      "text": "9. Uruksayas have kindled thee, Oblation-bearer, thee, with hymns.",
      "original": "तं त्वा गीर्भिरुरुक्षया हव्यवाहं समीधिरे ।",
      "translit": "taṃ tvā gīrbhirurukṣayā havyavāhaṃ samīdhire |"
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "refId": "RV10-118:19",
      "text": "Best Worshipper among mankind.",
      "original": "यजिष्ठं मानुषे जने",
      "translit": "yajiṣṭhaṃ mānuṣe jane"
    }
  ]
}
